  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pbt5](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pbt5) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 48.356 depth occurred on Feb 06 2025 50km N of Kalongan. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 4.4689 longitude 126.6945. It impacted 29050 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
